{"id":"n89073-1-6","stage":3,"title":"효자 · 孝子","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89073-1-6-1","ko":"어머니 아버지, 주말에 가족 여행 다녀와요.","zh":"爸爸妈妈，我们周末一起去家庭旅行吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지,","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"가족","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀와요.","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Kore